cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, its data or the dashboard, please cite the archived release below."
type: software
title: "Who the Market Reached: Thailand Primary Care Access"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and interactive dashboard on primary-care access in Thailand,
  2024–2026. In fiscal years 2024–25 the Universal Coverage Scheme grew its
  primary-care network by contracting private nurse clinics, pharmacies and
  medical clinics ("innovation units") instead of building public units. The
  repository tests where those units went, who they reached, and how a
  coverage-maximising planner would have done with the same number of sites.
  All numbers are preliminary.
